OL,3,AWhen will Poundland shops close? Five  
OL,4,Akey questions answered                 
OL,6,FPoundland shops will remain open as    
OL,7,Fusual for now. The firm collapsing has 
OL,8,Facted as a reset in the process of     
OL,9,Fselling it.                            
